div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Child Custody Attorneys in Lakewood, CO</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-466681d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"466681d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our Lakewood, CO Family Law Attorneys are here for your Divorce and Child Custody needs.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-909f951 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"909f951\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Contact Us For Consultation</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-56b4a08 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"74942\" data-id=\"56b4a08\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-44278860\" data-eae-slider=\"81912\" data-id=\"44278860\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23b1c378 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"23b1c378\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Child Custody Attorneys in Lakewood, CO</span>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-351ae5e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"351ae5e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group w-full text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 border-b border-black/10 dark:border-gray-900/50 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#444654]\"><div class=\"text-base gap-4 md:gap-6 md:max-w-2xl lg:max-w-2xl xl:max-w-3xl p-4 md:py-6 flex lg:px-0 m-auto\"><div class=\"relative flex w-[calc(100%-50px)] flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3 lg:w-[calc(100%-115px)]\"><div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"min-h-[20px] flex flex-col items-start gap-4 whitespace-pre-wrap\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"><p>The issue of <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/golden-child-custody/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">child custody</a> holds significant weight in a divorce, and it often becomes a matter of contention between parents who strive to secure their parental rights and involvement in their child&#8217;s life. At our law firm in Lakewood, CO, our child custody attorney comprehends the legal and emotional complexities involved in such cases. We can support you in surmounting obstacles and achieving an outcome that prioritizes your child&#8217;s welfare.</p><p>Our initial approach involves collaborating with the other parent to draft a custody agreement. However, if required, we are prepared to take the case to court. To explore your options, please <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">reach out</a> to our Lakewood child custody lawyers today.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30eb35bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"30eb35bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Consider Joint Custody: Is it the Right Choice for You and Your Child?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2064f702 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2064f702\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>When it comes to child custody, parents commonly receive joint physical and legal custody, which entails shared responsibility for the child&#8217;s physical and emotional well-being. However, this option is ideal for parents who can work together amicably, make decisions jointly, create a supportive environment for the child, communicate effectively, and maintain open lines of communication between the child and the other parent at all times.</p><p>In Colorado, child custody typically falls into two categories. Firstly, there is physical custody, which pertains to where the child primarily resides. When parents live close to each other, physical custody is often split, allowing the child to move between homes. However, if parents live far apart, dividing custody can pose challenges, particularly when they are in different school districts. In such situations our child custody lawyers can assist in devising a physical custody plan that enables both parents to spend time with their child without adding undue stress to the situation.</p><p>Legal custody also refers to the parent authorized to make decisions for the child, such as selecting their school and medical treatments. Joint legal custody is the most common arrangement, even if one parent has physical custody more frequently than the other.</p><p>If you&#8217;re facing a custody dispute, it&#8217;s crucial to seek legal advice from an experienced child custody lawyer who can assess your unique circumstances and provide guidance on the most appropriate course of action. Our Lakewood, Colorado child custody lawyers are well-versed in joint custody and other custody options and can help you determine the best approach for your family. <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Contact us today to schedule a consultation</a>.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5e87e1a1\" data-eae-slider=\"73142\" data-id=\"5e87e1a1\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-62369d18 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"80076\" data-id=\"62369d18\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-53898f20\" data-eae-slider=\"65665\" data-id=\"53898f20\" data-element_type=\"co